## Kernel

Fr3squ1nh0ROM uses **Nova-Kernel**, a Linux 5.4.302-based kernel supporting the Samsung Galaxy A52s 5G, Galaxy M52 5G and Galaxy A73 5G.

For Fr3squ1nh0ROM, the target device is the **Galaxy A52s 5G (SM-A528B / a52sxq)**.

Kernel source:

* Nova-Kernel — https://github.com/m52xq/Nova-Kernel

The kernel source is maintained separately from the Fr3squ1nh0ROM device tree and ROM sources.
